comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:18:12.602Z",codex-root,"Plan created only after all-status PM search, duplicate audit, and GitHub inventory found no matching active lineage."
  "2026-07-27T22:12:12.675Z",codex-root,"First exact-head review found three actionable improvements: reject selectors when the live action schema has no target contract, redact private entity selectors from live-test failure diagnostics, and isolate cross-transport action execution behind a typed API client. Base release commit was merged before applying the fixes; generated changelog wording was corrected at its canonical PM source."
  "2026-07-27T22:15:17.211Z",codex-root,"Verified CodeRabbit managed-package observations against the published PM 2026.7.27 SDK. The local listAllItemMetadata mirror hides two supported optional parameters but does not currently fail at runtime; managed extension type mirrors are upstream-owned and were reported after duplicate searches as unbraind/pm-cli#781. The similarity-label observation was rejected because the authoritative SDK explicitly reports exact_title, issue_code, and title_token_jaccard; package-managed sources were not hand-edited."
  "2026-07-27T22:19:29.994Z",codex-root,"Additional package-managed calendar and guide-shell review suggestions were verified after focused duplicate searches and reported upstream as unbraind/pm-cli#782: generic multi-word command normalization, shared status derivation, and explicit validation-only calendar intent. Consumer-managed package sources remain untouched."
  "2026-07-27T22:23:27.535Z",codex-root,"CI exposed a clean-runner dependency boundary hidden by the local global PM install: package-managed built-ins now statically import @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk, so the project must declare the latest PM CLI as a development dependency for module-graph verification. Added 2026.7.27 with Bun; this also makes changelog generation identical between local and clean runners."
  "2026-07-27T22:29:07.061Z",codex-root,"The remaining changelog failure was reproduced on GitHub's exact PR merge ref: the local clone had not yet fetched the newly created immutable v2026.7.26 tag, so the prior generation classified the merged media lineage as Unreleased. Fetching the PR merge ref brought the tag into the clone; regeneration now matches the full-history CI contract."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:18:12.602Z",codex-root,Keep all live identifiers and response payloads ephemeral; persist only contract shapes and counts.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:18:12.602Z",codex-root,Latest PM Plan schema expects evidence-bearing fields even when the plan primarily orchestrates an existing feature.
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  src/commands/services.ts,project,primary action command surface
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "bun run test:coverage",project,1200
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  docs/API.md,project,official action contract documentation
close_reason: All eight delivery steps completed with immutable pre-merge evidence and a clean exact-head GitHub fence.
plan_mode: completed
plan_validation[2]{text,command,expected}:
  Static and unit implementation gates,"bun run quality:static && bun run test:coverage","100 percent docstrings, source size compliant, lint/typecheck/duplication/shell pass, and 100/100/100/100 coverage"
  Privacy-safe live built CLI acceptance,"bun run build && bun run test:e2e:live","Wizard, six formats, schemas, WebSocket reads, dry-run safety, and required-response REST action pass without durable private identifiers"
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-27T21:19:03.013Z",codex-root,Ship one normalized action envelope while preserving the existing call-service positional command and --return-response flag.,A stable discriminated envelope is safer for programs than transport-dependent top-level shapes and avoids breaking command discovery.,Official June 2026 REST and WebSocket docs plus redacted Home Assistant 2026.7.4 live probe.
plan_discoveries[2]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:19:02.243Z",codex-root,"Current official REST returns either changed-state arrays or changed_states/service_response objects, while WebSocket returns context/response and separates target from service_data."
  "2026-07-27T21:41:24.017Z",codex-root,pm-cli history drift validation can retain stale cache results after clean mutations; pm gc runtime fixes the false gate. Upstream issue 779 tracks cache invalidation.
